WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:06.106
THAT'S THE, UH--OKAY, YOU GOT
THE MOST SPACE FOR ATTACHMENTS.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.208
ANYWAY...
- THANK YOU.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.043
- FEEL FREE TO HIT ME UP
IF YOU REMEMBER THAT NUMBER.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.046
I NOTICED YOU AIN'T
WRITE THAT DOWN.

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:15.682
DAMN, DAMN, DAMN.
THAT GIRL WAS FLY, RIGHT?

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.917
- [scoffs] SHE ALL RIGHT.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.252
BUT DID YOU SEE
THAT LIAM NEESONS MOVIE

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.421
WITH THEM WOLVES, THOUGH?

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:24.090
- THE ONE WITH THEM BIG-ASS
WOLVES AND LIAM NEESONS IN IT?

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.259
- MAN, LIAM NEESONS
IS MY [bleep]!

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.461
- OH, LIAM NEESONS STRAIGHT
JACKED UP THEM WOLVES, MAN.

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:30.030
- MAN, HE [bleep]
THEM WOLVES UP, MAN.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.032
- YEAH.
- SHOOT, MAN.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.733
HEY, AND DON'T EVEN GET ME
STARTED ON THAT ONE

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.802
WHERE THEY TOOK
HIS DAUGHTER.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:37.670
- [scoffs] "STRAIGHT TOOKEN,"
STARRING LIAM NEESONS!

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.439
- MAN, LIAM NEESONS
ON THE PHONE LIKE,

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:41.274
"I HAVE A CERTAIN
SET OF SKILLS."

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.410
MAN, DON'T [bleep]
WITH LIAM NEESONS!

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.278
- NO, DON'T EVEN TRY AND
BE RUSSIAN AROUND LIAM NEESONS.

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:47.414
HE'LL TAKE YOUR ARM AND...
- [screams]

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.382
- PUT SOME FRACTURES UP IN THAT.
- THEY KILLING HIM, MAN.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.384
AND THEN--OH, YOU SEE
THE SECOND ONE, THOUGH?

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.153
IN THE SECOND ONE,
THE RUSSIANS COME AFTER HIM

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.221
AND HE [bleep] THEM
ALL UP ANYWAY.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.023
- "TAKEN 2," STARRING
THE INCOMPARABLE LIAM NEESONS.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.892
- MM-HM. MM-HM.
- THAT'S MY [bleep].

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.027
- WHAT ABOUT<i> DARKMAN,</i> THOUGH?
- NO.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:03.396
- WHAT ABOUT LIAM NEESONS
IN SOME<i> DARKMAN,</i> THOUGH?

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.432
WHAT ABOUT<i> DARKMAN,</i> THOUGH?

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.967
- WHEN LIAM NEESONS' FACE
WAS CHANGING UP, MAN?

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:10.603
- HOMIE WAS STRAIGHT
FACE-CHANGING.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.872
NOW THAT'S JUST LIAM NEESONS
ACTING RIGHT THERE, MAN.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:16.209
- STRAIGHT UP, I KID YOU NOT.
ACADEMY-AWARD CALIBER.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.278
CLASSIC NEESONS.
- MAN, COME ON, SERIOUSLY.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:20.847
I MEAN, LIKE, NEESONS
ALREADY NEED TO HAVE A STATUE.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:22.649
- LIAM NEESONS AIN'T GOT NO--
- HE AIN'T GOT NO STATUE.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:23.850
- HE--
- HE AIN'T GOT A STATUE.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:25.018
HE AIN'T GOT A STATUE.

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:26.586
- NO. NO. NO. NO.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.624
THE OSCAR GOES
TO LIAM NEESONS,<i> DARKMAN.</i>

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.593
[bleep] FACE WAS CHANGING!
- MM-HM. WORD.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.295
- HOW HARD IS THAT?
- IT AIN'T HARD.

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.130
IT'S NOT HARD AT ALL.
- DAMN!

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:39.566
- IT'S STUPID.
- OH! OH!<i> BATTLESHIP.</i>

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.102
- OOOH!

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.837
-<i> BATTLESHIP.</i>

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:45.705
- OOOH!

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.974
<i> - BATTLESHIP!</i>

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.143
- OOOOH!

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.411
OOOOH!
-<i> BATTLESHIP!</i>

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:53.913
- OOOOH! WHOO!

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.783
- LIAM NEESONS STRAIGHT
KILLED A ROBOT BOAT!

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:01.287
- LIAM NEESONS IS MY SHIZNIT!
- WHOO!

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.123
- BUT YOU KNOW WHO I LIKE
AS MUCH AS NEESONS, THOUGH?

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:04.457
- [scoffs] AS MUCH AS NEESONS?
- MM-HM.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:05.892
- WHO?

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:06.960
- BRUCE WILLY.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:11.030
- [screams]

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:14.834
[screaming continues]

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:17.203
BRUCE WILLY IS MY SHIT!

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.005
- BUT WHAT IF
THEY MADE A MOVIE

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:21.107
WITH LIAM NEESONS
AND BRUCE WILLY?

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:22.742
[grunting]

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:24.777
- NEESONS AND WILLY?

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:27.013
- WILLY AND NEESONS.
- HARDER MAN. HARDER!

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.715
- [grunting]

00:02:28.882 --> 00:02:30.817
- [choking]
THAT WOULD BE...

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:35.622
both: MY [bleep]!

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:36.788
[boom]

